{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "通过Relayr快捷记账",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1967",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "通过Relayr快捷记账",
        "level": 1
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Cent现在支持更方便的一键快捷记账了，通过Relayr，Cent可以绕过iOS对web app的限制，直接从快捷指令获取数据。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1968",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "使用方法：",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1969",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "使用方法",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "iOS",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1970",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "iOS",
        "level": 3
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "第一步：按照Cent中的指引，复制配置文本",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1971",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "第二步：点击安装快捷指令按钮，安装快捷指令（注意需要同时安装豆包）",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1972",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "第三步：将第一步复制的文本粘贴到快捷指令安装问题中，即可实现快捷记账。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1973",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "如何使用：",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1974",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "可以在控制中心里设置一个快捷指令按钮，选择“Cent 快捷记账Relayr版”，这样需要记账的时候，下拉控制中心运行快捷指令，就会自动截图并识别文本，然后将文本发给豆包进行分析，分析完成后，会自动打开Cent，然后就可以自动记录到账单中了。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1975",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Android",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1976",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "Android",
        "level": 3
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "由于安卓端没有统一的快捷指令App，建议阅读下方的Relayr原理后，手动通过Macrodroid、Tasker、Auto.js等自动化软件构建自己的快捷记账方式，暂时没有统一的方法。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1977",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Relayr原理",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1978",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "Relayr原理",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Relayr是一个免费的匿名阅后即焚服务，它部署在supabase上，可以指定一个key，然后将文本上传到key中，文本将会保存1分钟，之后会被销毁，在此之前，任何人都可以通过key获取到该文本，并且文本被读取过一次之后会被直接销毁。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1979",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Cent通过为每一个设备创建一个UUID作为存储key（passcode），并通过配置文件与快捷指令共享，当快捷指令需要发送数据给Cent时，实际上是将数据通过该passcode存储在Relayr中，然后打开Cent，Cent会去读取Relayr中的对应内容，即完成一次单向的数据传输。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1980",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "为了防止其他用户通过遍历key的方式获取到传输内容，Relayr除了限制ip过于频繁地访问之外，还提供了加密选项，可以通过在存储数据时加入encryptionKey参数进行加密，这样存储的数据就是加密后的数据，即使通过“撞库”的方式偶然发现了未被销毁的数据，也无法解密。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1981",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "可以通过如下方式存储数据到Relayr中：",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1982",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "curl -X POST 'RELAYR_URL' \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{ \"content\": \"Sensitive Data\", key: \"passcode\", \"encryptionKey\": \"encryptKey\" }'",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1983",
      "props": {
        "language": "bash"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "如果你想要自定义快捷指令或者其他自动化软件，可以从Relayr配置文件中获取需要的数据，例如passcode、prompt等，然后基于以上原理替换成自己的实现，只要最后存储的数据符合prompt中的xml格式定义，Cent就会自动识别出账单并记录。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1984",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "注意事项",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1985",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "注意事项",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Cent将所需的配置都放置在了配置文件中，包含",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "RELAYR_URL",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "passcode",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "encryptKey",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "，以及用户的分类数据等，请务必保证该配置文件只在特定设备中使用，不要泄漏，如果担心可能已经意外泄漏，可以通过关闭再打开Relayr开关来重置配置文件，注意每次重启开关都必须重新复制配置文件到快捷指令，才能正常生效。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_ba4366c792fe4597c96faec4_b1986",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
